<title>USA: Wilton, Conn., won by State Street.</title>
<headline>Wilton, Conn., won by State Street.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Bank &amp; Trust Co. said it won $3.060 million of Wilton, Conn., general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.772 percent.</p>
</text>
